{
  "schema": "calcdb.question/1",
  "probe": "r-sql-2-3/pivot-headings",
  "bookRefs": [
    "R-SQL-3",
    "SQL-PIVOT-01",
    "SQL-PIVOT-04"
  ],
  "description": "Crosstab column headings and their names. For each TRANSFORM Sum(Amt) ... GROUP BY Grp: dynamic PIVOT Piv (holds 'a' and 'A'); fixed IN ('c','b','a','zz','a') (reversed, duplicate, absent); IN ('A','a'); PIVOT PN (Long); PIVOT CStr(PN); PIVOT IIf(ID Mod 2 = 0, PN, CStr(PN)) (Long and Text values that print the same); PN IN (1, '2', 3.0); PIVOT PD (dates); PIVOT Odd (values with ], ., !, a leading space, an inner space and 70 characters). Asks Fields Count, Name, Type and Size before the first move, then all rows.",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
  "observationRecipe": [
    "clearErrorInfoBefore",
    "excepinfo",
    "deferredFill",
    "errorInfo"
  ],
